<h2>1. Digital Knowledge Sharing &amp; Request-Mapping Platforms</h2>
<p>The intersection of internal knowledge management and external request-mapping in the social sector is currently addressesed via three main avenues:</p>
<h3>Dedicated Impact Networks &amp; Request-Mapping Platforms</h3>
<ul>
