</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Regional Open-Source Networks:</strong> Grassroots networks frequently leverage regional bespoke or open-source community networks (e.g., <em>Passerelles</em> in French-speaking ecosystems) to share proposal templates, operational knowledge, and peer-to-peer resource matching.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3>The Generative AI Paradigm Shift</h3>
